<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Capítulo IV - ESCACE</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400,700" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
/* =========================================
   BASE
========================================= */

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Roboto', sans-serif;
    background:#f4f1ea;
    color:#333;
}

.container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:80px auto;
    padding:30px;
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

h1{
    color:#22508e;
    font-size:34px;
}

h2{
    color:#a2915F;
    margin-top:50px;
}

h3{
    color:#555;
    font-weight:400;
}

p{
    line-height:1.8;
}

.big-text{
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.chapter-title{
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#a2915F;
}


/* =========================================
   ANIMACIÓN
========================================= */

.story-block{
    margin:85px 0;
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(60px) scale(0.98);
    filter:blur(6px);
    transition:1s ease;
}

.story-block.visible{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
    filter:blur(0);
}


/* =========================================
   DESTACADOS
========================================= */

.highlight{
    background:rgba(162,145,95,0.12);
    padding:25px;
    border-left:5px solid #a2915F;
    border-radius:6px;
}


/* =========================================
   BLOQUES CINEMATOGRÁFICOS
========================================= */

.cinematic{
    background:#111;
    color:#fff;
    padding:80px 30px;
    text-align:center;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

.cinematic p{
    font-size:20px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
}


/* =========================================
   MEDIOS
========================================= */

.media-block{
    margin:40px 0;
}

.media-block img,
.media-block video{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition:0.5s;
}

.media-block img:hover,
.media-block video:hover{
    transform:scale(1.02);
}


/* =========================================
   HERO
========================================= */

.hero{
    height:70vh;
    background:url('img/hero-cap3.webp') center/cover no-repeat;
    position:relative;
    border-radius:10px;
    margin-bottom:60px;
}

.hero::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    border-radius:10px;
}

.hero-text{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:40px;
    left:40px;
    color:white;
    z-index:2;
}

.hero-text h1{
    color:white;
    margin:0;
}


/* =========================================
   NAVEGACIÓN SUPERIOR
========================================= */

.top-bar{
    position:fixed;
    top:20px;
    left:20px;
    z-index:999;
}

.top-bar a{
    background:#22508e;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:12px 18px;
    border-radius:30px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    transition:0.3s;
}

.top-bar a:hover{
    background:#1b3f70;
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}


/* =========================================
   BOTÓN ARRIBA
========================================= */

.back-top{
    position:fixed;
    bottom:30px;
    right:30px;
    background:#a2915F;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    padding:15px 18px;
    border-radius:50%;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:20px;
    display:none;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    z-index:999;
}

.back-top:hover{
    transform:scale(1.1);
}


/* =========================================
   CARRUSEL
========================================= */

.slider{
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    max-width:900px;
    margin:30px auto;
    background:#111;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
}

.slides{
    display:flex;
    transition:transform .55s ease;
}

.slides img{
    width:100%;
    flex-shrink:0;
    display:block;
    user-select:none;
    -webkit-user-drag:none;
}

.prev,
.next{
    position:absolute;
    top:50%;
    transform:translateY(-50%);
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
    color:#fff;
    border:none;
    width:45px;
    height:45px;
    border-radius:50%;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:22px;
    z-index:5;
    transition:.3s;
}

.prev:hover,
.next:hover{
    background:#22508e;
}

.prev{
    left:15px;
}

.next{
    right:15px;
}


/* =========================================
   PUNTOS
========================================= */

.dots{
    text-align:center;
    padding:14px 10px 18px;
    background:#111;
}

.dot{
    display:inline-block;
    width:8px;
    height:8px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#777;
    margin:4px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.3s;
}

.dot.active{
    background:#a2915F;
    transform:scale(1.35);
}


/* =========================================
   CONTADOR DE ARCHIVO
========================================= */

.archive-counter{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:15px;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    color:#777;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}


/* =========================================
   BLOQUE DE ARCHIVO VISUAL
========================================= */

.archive-intro{
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px 20px 10px;
}

.archive-intro h2{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:30px;
}

.archive-intro p{
    max-width:720px;
    margin:15px auto;
    font-size:18px;
}

.archive-label{
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#a2915F;
}


/* =========================================
   TESTIMONIO
========================================= */

.testimony{
    background:#111;
    color:#fff;
    padding:50px 30px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

.testimony-label{
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#a2915F;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.testimony h2{
    color:#fff;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.testimony p{
    color:#ddd;
    max-width:700px;
    margin:15px auto;
}

.testimony video{
    width:100%;
    margin-top:30px;
    border-radius:8px;
}


/* =========================================
   CIERRE GENERACIONAL
========================================= */

.generation-video{
    background:#111;
    color:white;
    padding:60px 30px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

.generation-video .chapter-title{
    color:#a2915F;
}

.generation-video h2{
    color:white;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.generation-video p{
    color:#ccc;
    max-width:700px;
    margin:15px auto;
}

.generation-video video{
    width:100%;
    margin-top:30px;
    border-radius:8px;
}


/* =========================================
   NAVEGACIÓN DE CAPÍTULOS
========================================= */

.chapter-nav{
    margin-top:80px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:15px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.chapter-nav a{
    text-decoration:none;
    background:#22508e;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 20px;
    border-radius:8px;
}


/* =========================================
   RESPONSIVE
========================================= */

@media(max-width:600px){

    .container{
        margin:30px 10px;
        padding:20px;
    }

    .hero{
        height:55vh;
    }

    .hero-text{
        left:25px;
        bottom:25px;
    }

    .hero-text h1{
        font-size:28px;
    }

    h1{
        font-size:28px;
    }

    .big-text{
        font-size:18px;
    }

    .prev,
    .next{
        width:38px;
        height:38px;
        font-size:18px;
    }

}

</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>CAPÍTULO IV</h1>
        <p>1948-2001 ESCACE</p>
		<p>Escuela Superior de Contaduria y Administración de Celaya</p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="top-bar">
    <a href="index.html">← Timeline</a>
</div>

<div class="story-block visible">

<div class="story-block highlight">
    Por primera vez, la contaduría y la administración tienen un espacio propio.
</div>

<p class="big-text">
Hay momentos en los que una institución deja de crecer solo en número y comienza a crecer en identidad.
Este periodo es uno de ellos.
</p>
</div>

<div class="story-block media">
<img src="img/ESCACE.webp" alt="ESCACE antiguo edificio">
</div>

<div class="story-block">
<h2>1973 · El nacimiento de ESCACE</h2>

<p>
La separación entre la Escuela Preparatoria y la Escuela de Comercio y Administración marca un punto de inflexión.
</p>

<p>
Nace la Escuela Superior de Contaduria y Administración de Celaya: ESCACE.
</p>
</div>

<div class="gallery story-block">
<img src="img/cap4-intro1.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-intro2.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-intro3.webp">
</div>

<div class="highlight story-block">
<div class="big-text">
No era una reorganización. Era el reconocimiento de una identidad propia.
</div>
</div>

<div class="story-block cinematic">
<p>El Bajío crece</p>
<p>La industria avanza</p>
<p>La educación responde</p>
</div>

<div class="gallery story-block">
<img src="img/cap4-intro-edif1.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-intro-edif2.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-intro-edif3.webp">
</div>

<div class="media story-block">
<img src="img/cap4-intro-edif4.webp">
</div>

<div class="highlight story-block">
<div class="big-text">
El espacio físico también construye identidad.
</div>
</div>

<div class="story-block">
<h2>Crecimiento académico</h2>
<p>Se amplían programas, infraestructura y matrícula.</p>
</div>

<div class="gallery story-block">
<img src="img/cap4-cres-01.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-cres-02.webp">
<img src="img/cap4-cres-03.webp">
</div>

<div class="story-block cinematic">
<p>La Escuela evoluciona</p>
<p>La identidad se consolida</p>
